 "summary": "A small-signal N-channel enhancement MOSFET for 30 V and 0.1 A, in the three-lead SOT-323. On-resistance is no more than 8 Ω with 4 V on the gate and 13 Ω with 2.5 V, and the threshold sits between 0.8 and 1.5 V. Back-to-back zener diodes between gate and source guard the gate. It is offered for interfacing and for load switching.",
